                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b9bc227-51b5-3697-a9bc-81a3cbe419e9",
                        "entry_id": "efce4c16-358d-3855-b838-a7abc612fefa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "człowiek zarozumiały, pyszny, butny"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af63deb0-4add-4c63-aac6-d45ab80740ec",
                                "sense_id": "2b9bc227-51b5-3697-a9bc-81a3cbe419e9",
                                "text": "Fanfaron nosi głowę wysoko."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f1e461e-5052-410b-9f84-fe240d92e05e",
                        "source_entry_id": "efce4c16-358d-3855-b838-a7abc612fefa",
                        "source_sense_id": "2b9bc227-51b5-3697-a9bc-81a3cbe419e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "braggart",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "braggart",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51a5f380-8ed2-363d-a1a6-c1b7b4e7f874",
                                        "entry_id": "d4263855-a5b4-3026-8f30-e680ffd76e90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who constantly brags or boasts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45ee1c6c-31ca-432b-a027-b58643e30774",
                                                "sense_id": "51a5f380-8ed2-363d-a1a6-c1b7b4e7f874",
                                                "text": "O I could play the woman with mine eyes, / And Braggart with my tongue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c28d36b-c048-4b66-bfc6-354dfea54a86",
                                                "sense_id": "51a5f380-8ed2-363d-a1a6-c1b7b4e7f874",
                                                "text": "Shallow water gives a great splash, and so a braggart has ever been contemptible in my eyes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0252817-6318-4df5-bf66-61e17cd51ecd",
                                                "sense_id": "51a5f380-8ed2-363d-a1a6-c1b7b4e7f874",
                                                "text": "A very good resolve to make and keep, if you would also keep any friends you make, is never to speak of anyone without, in imagination, having them overhear what you say. One often hears the exclamation “I would say it to her face!” At least be very sure that this is true, and not a braggart’s phrase and then—nine times out of ten think better of it and refrain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "braggart",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "336ff6e6-9f5d-308e-9dcd-607807d12863",
                                        "entry_id": "861e2e01-a1f5-3da6-9ac2-773aa61cf329",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by boasting; boastful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c1db0ef-a178-4608-a7ea-1eb19c556420",
                                                "sense_id": "336ff6e6-9f5d-308e-9dcd-607807d12863",
                                                "text": "O my fair Mistress, Truth! Shall I quit thee, / For huffing, braggart, puft Nobility?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebb6c33c-8136-4fda-81ff-ca2f33315b95",
                                                "sense_id": "336ff6e6-9f5d-308e-9dcd-607807d12863",
                                                "text": "Captain [Benjamin] Bonneville was delighted with the game look of these cavaliers of the mountains, welcomed them heartily to his camp, and ordered a free allowance of grog to regale them, which soon put them in the most braggart spirits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22616bb0-e631-4830-8ad3-c9cdce94b965",
                                                "sense_id": "336ff6e6-9f5d-308e-9dcd-607807d12863",
                                                "text": "He took him on the long walks of which he was fond, and made him in some sort his humble confidant, talking to him of himself and his plans with large and braggart vagueness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c7e10dc3-33d8-4d8c-9377-8c55015069c2",
                        "source_entry_id": "efce4c16-358d-3855-b838-a7abc612fefa",
                        "source_sense_id": "2b9bc227-51b5-3697-a9bc-81a3cbe419e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "fanfaron",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fanfaron",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                        "entry_id": "c0f61c7d-bde2-3552-b6d6-d3d69411c4bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vantard, hâbleur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67a373e1-7b4c-4745-89b3-7b1873810532",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                                "text": "Air fanfaron."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abb300c3-af64-4cc4-8398-af4b9f9fc3e6",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                                "text": "Attitude fanfaronne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7bdd9ff-6415-4f2a-bd54-1355d8fa1cb2",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                                "text": "Callot est net, clair, fin, précis, fidèle au vrai, malgré le maniéré de ses tournures et l’extravagance fanfaronne de ses ajustements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "451ba88f-dea0-4015-8006-fc1be1814d08",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                                "text": "Nous ne rêvions qu’orangers, citronniers, cachuchas, castagnettes, basquines et costumes pittoresques, car tout le monde nous faisait des récits merveilleux de l’Andalousie avec cette emphase un peu fanfaronne dont les Espagnols ne se déshabitueront jamais, pas plus que les Gascons de France."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d056ff4-21a5-45c8-ae5d-b5a84ca8f016",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                                "text": "Et comme il se fût réjoui encore à voir par le monde tant de soldats fanfarons : Miles semper gloriosus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dafe2c83-d29c-492d-a5f5-a9e6abdfa7a1",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b4a111-bbf6-3cb6-ac66-70126ced0782",
                                                "text": "« Par un étrange malentendu – ou disons par une forme d’exagération fanfaronne à laquelle les Orientaux ne répugnent pas –, on attribue à Tanios le rôle le plus éminent qui soit, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fanfaron",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2d6d44a-b6c1-30ab-9d08-1f135381f8f4",
                                        "entry_id": "838618da-e4db-3a5c-b530-733cc1d0be4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui se vante, qui étale une prétendue bravoure, ou toute autre qualité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dc8c26e-c4e0-4924-a9be-ad8bc82a1308",
                                                "sense_id": "f2d6d44a-b6c1-30ab-9d08-1f135381f8f4",
                                                "text": "Dans la cour des grands ?\nQui fait semblant\nle Coq, le fanfaron, la putain\nQui tourne en rond\nTu crois gérer\nMais t’es mal digéré\nIl est où le p’tiot qu’t’étais ?\nIl est mort le p’tiot qu’t’étais ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd6bde87-631d-450e-b249-b470485d6d0f",
                                                "sense_id": "f2d6d44a-b6c1-30ab-9d08-1f135381f8f4",
                                                "text": "D’ailleurs, ami jusqu’à l’échafaud, fanfaron de cynisme et simple comme un enfant, il ne travaillait que par boutade ou par nécessité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbfc5283-ecad-4175-b230-96415ce5a2f4",
                                                "sense_id": "f2d6d44a-b6c1-30ab-9d08-1f135381f8f4",
                                                "text": "J'ai souvenir encore de quatre jeunes garçons\n Qui avaient grand plaisir à jouer les fanfarons\n Les garçons de mon âge avaient comme voisinage\n Robineux du Viger, putains d' la Saint-Laurent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
